OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CCosmetic crackdown should be sped up   
OL,5,Csays charity                           
OL,6,GThe director of a safer cosmetics      
OL,7,Gcharity has called for the government  
OL,8,Gto speed up a crackdown on so-called   
OL,9,G"cosmetic cowboys".                    
OL,11,FAlice Webb, a mother-of-five from      
OL,12,FWotton-under-Edge, collapsed and died  
OL,13,Ffollowing a liquid Brazilian butt lift 
OL,14,F(BBL) procedure in September 2024,     
OL,16,FAt the end of her inquest on Friday, a 
OL,17,Fjury concluded her death was           
OL,18,Faccidental but the coroner ruled there 
OL,19,Fwere "significant risks" of future     
OL,20,Fdeaths and plans to send a report to   
OL,21,Fthe government.                        
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
