OL,4,CItems from Ann Widdecombe's estate up  
OL,5,Cfor auction                            
OL,6,GItems from the estate of Ann           
OL,7,GWiddecombe are set to go up for        
OL,8,Gauction next month.                    
OL,10,FThe former MP was found dead at her    
OL,11,Fhome in Haytor, Devon, on 9 July and a 
OL,12,F28-year-old man from Rotherham, South  
OL,13,FYorkshire was charged with her murder. 
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
