OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CMan denies murder of woman, 81, in     
OL,5,C'brutal assault'                       
OL,6,GA 37-year-old man has pleaded not      
OL,7,Gguilty to the murder and serious       
OL,8,Gsexual assault of an 81-year-old woman.
OL,10,FEdward Holden, of Alexandra Place,     
OL,11,FPenzance, pleaded guilty to            
OL,12,Fmanslaughter and two sexual offences   
OL,13,Fafter Jenny Firth was found dead at    
OL,14,Fher home in the village of Ashton,     
OL,15,Fnear Helston, on 29 May.               
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
