OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CHomes could be built on former RAF base
OL,5,GA former RAF base which was earmarked  
OL,6,Gto be a command centre in the event of 
OL,7,Ga nuclear war could become the site    
OL,8,Gfor 167 homes.                         
OL,10,FPlans have been submitted which would  
OL,11,Fturn the derelict site, at Rudloe near 
OL,12,FCorsham in Wiltshire, into a           
OL,13,Fresidential community.                 
OL,15,FTaylor Wimpey, which submitted the     
OL,16,Fplans, said 33 of the homes would be   
OL,17,Faffordable and - if planning           
OL,18,Fpermission is granted - work would     
OL,19,Fstart on the development in 2027.      
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
